From: ArchPad Project <https://github.com/pipa-mainline>
Subject: [PATCH] apps_std: suppress expected temp.json write rejection spam

Qualcomm sensor DSP firmware periodically probes write capability by attempting
to open <registry>/../temp.json. HexagonFS is read-only by design. Suppress
logging this expected denial so the system journal is not flooded with thousands
of repetitive log messages.
---
--- a/hexagonrpcd/apps_std.c
+++ b/hexagonrpcd/apps_std.c
@@ -204,8 +204,11 @@ static uint32_t apps_std_fopen_with_env(void *data,

 	rw_mode = ((const char *) inbufs[4].p)[0];
 	if (rw_mode == 'w' || rw_mode == 'a') {
-		fprintf(stderr, "Tried to open %s for writing\n",
-				(const char *) inbufs[3].p);
+		const char *path = (const char *) inbufs[3].p;
+		if (!strstr(path, "temp.json")) {
+			fprintf(stderr, "Tried to open %s for writing\n",
+					path);
+		}
 		return AEE_EUNSUPPORTED;
 	}

